description:
Implement an 8-bit Gray-to-Binary converter. The module takes an 8-bit Gray code input and systematically transforms it into its corresponding Binary code output. The conversion leverages bitwise XOR operations to derive each bit of the Binary output from the appropriate bits of the Gray input, ensuring accurate representation in Binary format.
module top_module(
    input wire [7:0] gray_input,
    output reg [7:0] bin_out
);

